meta {
  name: List projects
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/projects
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  ~includeSummary: false
  ~status: active,planned
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  User story 5. A project is a *label with a budget*, not a container: a
  transaction belongs to one account and optionally one project, so "spent on
  the remodel" and "spent from chequing" stay independent questions.
  
  The seed has three: `proj_remodel` (active kitchen remodel), `proj_france`
  (planned, deposits already paid) and `proj_office` (completed).
}
